  :TSC_CALIBRATED :profile
  ;; NOT blocked, and NOT unwritten -- corrected 2026-09-09, one iteration
  ;; after this map first said :unwritten. The code is all there: pci.c drives
  ;; stages 1..16 and main.c reports at 5, 12 and 16. What fails is the LIVE
