  ;; ⚠ CORRECTED 2026-09-10: this group is NOT closable without anything else,
  ;; and the previous sentence here said it was. Measured by the same scan that
  ;; attributed the six :profile markers above -- every SSH marker, these three
  ;; included, is emitted from inside `#ifdef AIUEOS_SSH_LISTEN`:
