  ;;
  ;; The rest of the old note stands and is worth keeping: "write the missing
  ;; code" was ALSO wrong once, and would have sent a reader hunting for code
  ;; that is already written. pci.c drives stages 1..16 and main.c reports at
  ;; 5, 12 and 16. Two wrong descriptions of the same three markers, a day
  ;; apart, both pointing the next reader somewhere there was nothing to do.
  :SSH_KEX_REPLY :live-exchange-stalls
  :SSH_AUTH :live-exchange-stalls
  :SSH_SESSION :live-exchange-stalls
  :RTL8125_SSH_SESSION :board
  ;; Attributed 2026-11-02 by MEASUREMENT: exactly the eight CORE markers
  ;; PR #1177 registered and left unattributed (unclassified 63 -> 71 when the
  ;; denominator went 117 -> 125). Every claim below was checked today against
